  "details": "I would love to have built-in functionality for automatically logging **which world you met someone in** or **what avatar they were wearing** at the time of a friend request.  \n\nIt helps provide context if you add someone but then don't play for a few weeks (people change avatars and names).  The Add Note feature is useful but is manual you'd need to write that context yourself.  \n\nMaybe just a \"metadata\" auto fill button you could click that would populate the note?",
